[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_lleqh"]
script = ExtResource("8_ova88")
name = "Note"
description = "[b]Patient's Record #5[/b]
Date: 24/12/2025

Patient's Name: Tawan Sukhumvitayaporn
Gender: Male
Age: 25
Blood Type: A

Description:
Suffered minor injuries and broken left ankle from car accident. Luckily, there is a good citizen brought him to the hospital.
Name of that person is Kmsodfmsamlfd,sadfie----

Assigned to Bed #0340"
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://duu02ylefpfev"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_xrbrr"]
script = ExtResource("8_ova88")
name = "Note"
description = "[b]Map Locations[/b]
- [color=green]Green[/color]: Examination Room
- [color=#eb0cd4]Pink[/color]: Mini-Ward
- [color=#ebba34]Yellow[/color]: Maintenance
- [color=blue]Blue[/color]: Janitor Storage
- [color=red]Red: Red Room[/color]
"
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://duu02ylefpfev"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_corsv"]
script = ExtResource("8_ova88")
name = "Note"
description = "Pain has an element of blank;
It cannot recollect
When it began, or if there were
A day when it was not.

It has no future but itself,
Its infinite realms contain
Its past, enlightened to perceive
New periods of pain.
"
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://duu02ylefpfev"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_oownl"]
script = ExtResource("8_ova88")
name = "Note"
description = "Notice:
- Please refrain from running in hallway.
- No smoking within the facility.

Allowed Visit Time:
8.00 AM - 17.00 PM

Thank you for your cooperation
"
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://duu02ylefpfev"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_gkmjm"]
script = ExtResource("8_ova88")
name = "Note"
description = "[color=red]DEAD END[/color]"
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://duu02ylefpfev"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_ckc4g"]
script = ExtResource("8_ova88")
name = "Note"
description = "[b]Patient's Record #2[/b]
Date: 01/08/2023

Patient's Name: Joe Tanasin
Gender: Male
Age: 55
Blood Type: O

Description:
Non-responsive to final round of chemotherapy. Patient is bed-bound and requires 24/7 morphine drip for pain regulation. Expected prognosis: Weeks/Days

Assigned to Bed #1431"
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://duu02ylefpfev"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_bkbm0"]
script = ExtResource("8_ova88")
name = "Note"
description = "I think I found him.

A perfect vessel.

Someone without any attachment.

I shall proceed with the plan and get him here.

It won't be long now, father.

You'll be able to live a normal live once again."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://duu02ylefpfev"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_vtruy"]
script = ExtResource("8_ova88")
name = "Note"
description = "\"Don't worry Mr. Joe, I will not left you alone like the others.\"

\"You have taught me many things.\"

\"I will find a way to help you no matter what.\"

\"Even if I have to do  [b]that...[/b]\""
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://duu02ylefpfev"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_k16l5"]
script = ExtResource("8_ova88")
name = "Note"
description = "I don't really get why they changed the policy to make lost and found box into lost and found safe.

They all forgot to tell me the password too. I am the one who do everything around here. Unacceptable."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://duu02ylefpfev"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_c2b25"]
script = ExtResource("8_ova88")
name = "Note"
description = "[b]Recent changes about Lost and Found[/b]

Due to recent feedback regarding the security of items within our Lost and Found, we are implementing a new protocol to ensure the safety of recovered property. Effective immediately, all high-value or sensitive items will be secured in a dedicated onsite safe rather than being kept in open storage.

[b]Security Access[/b]
To access the safe, authorized personnel must enter a 4-digit security code. If you have forgotten the combination, please solve the following riddle:

[b]The Code of Four[/b]

[i]I am the number of legs on a lonely chair,
Add the wheels on a unicycle found at the fair.
Next, find the sides of a triangle's face,
And end with the legs of a spider’s embrace.[/i]"
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://duu02ylefpfev"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_4wqlp"]
script = ExtResource("8_ova88")
name = "Note"
description = "Weekly Complains:
- Someone forget to clean up after themselves after taking a dump in the toilet plus that toilet is broken right now

- Janitor lost his key to the equipment room

-When will there be free WiFi

- WHAT DO YOU MEAN I HAVE TO SOLVE RIDDLES FOR PASSWORD!"
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://duu02ylefpfev"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_bau3d"]
script = ExtResource("8_ova88")
name = "Note"
description = "Janitor has lost his key to the janitor room and the spare key is nowhere to be found. If you find them, please give it to the janitor.

Thank you"
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://duu02ylefpfev"

